<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clan Quartermaster</h1>
<p>Usage (for the clan Master, or a member of rank 25):
</p>
<pre>cappoint &lt;member&gt; quartermaster
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cappoint fizban quartermaster
</pre>
<p>A quartermaster is a trusted member of the clan who may take equipment out 
of the clan's secret storage, the clan chest (<a cmd='#'>Help Cunstore</a>). Any member 
can put things in (<a cmd='#'>Help Cstore</a>) and see what is there 
(<a cmd='#'>Help Cequipment</a>); only the quartermasters and the clan Master can take 
them out. A clan can have several quartermasters. To take the position 
away again, see <a cmd='#'>Help Cdepose</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cunstore</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cappoint</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Treasurer</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Master</a>
</pre>




</div>